body:
@XiaotaoChen Hi, this is indeed quite strange, and it’s difficult to pinpoint the exact cause directly. I’d suggest checking a few things:

1. Whether gdrcopy_copybw and gdrcopy_copylat run normally;
2. Whether there’s an issue in the RDMA registration when obtaining the GPU memory address (based on [Mooncake issue #351](https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/issues/351#issuecomment-2915187866))
.
